    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #354\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed commit `d1daa1c` to branch `bb/relay-235-system-i18n-01-05-add-stable-database-thr_49gc7rz8cw` (existing branch tied to PR #354, no new branch created).\n\nThis push addresses the AI code review feedback on PR #354:\n- **HIGH**: scoped the `0028_database_keys_nullable_names.sql` backfill's property-name nulling to only the built-in keys `seedTenDatabasesInTransaction` itself creates per database, so properties added by later module seeds (e.g. `seedEmailModule.ts`'s `People.emails`) are no longer wiped on an upgrade install.\n- **MEDIUM**: `databasesStore.ts`'s `createDatabase` now rejects a `key` on a non-system database.\n- Added regression tests for both fixes.\n\nVerified this turn: full build, lint, `check:boundaries`, migration-numbering check, format check, and all three test tiers (unit 114/114, integration 767/767, e2e 5/5) pass.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
