    "body": "Relay BB run pushed an update.\n\nPull request: #354\n\nTokens: 0 · Cost: $0.0000\n\nPushed commit `2f2d931` to branch `bb/relay-235-system-i18n-01-05-add-stable-database-thr_49gc7rz8cw` (existing branch tied to PR #354, no new branch created).\n\nThis push addresses the LOW-priority suggestion from the latest code review: `createDatabase` now rejects a system database created with both `name` and `key` null, since `permissionManifest`'s fallback chain (`db.name ?? db.key ?? db.id`) would otherwise surface a raw UUID as the display label. Added a regression test.\n\nVerified this turn: full build, lint, format check, `check:boundaries`, migration-numbering check, and all three test tiers (unit 114/114, integration 768/768, e2e 5/5) pass.\n\nRelay-Step-Status: pass",
